WEBVTT

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:06.840
<i>This world is separated into 
six nations, the Six Powers.</i>

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.980
<i>The country of the angels, the Sky Realm.</i>

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.540
<i>The military state, the Spar Realm.</i>

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:15.120
<i>The country of eternal night, the Hell Realm.</i>

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.990
<i>Gajeru's home, the country of 
the animals, the Animal Realm.</i>

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:22.600
<i>Liza's home, the country
 of witches, the Blood Realm.</i>

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.730
<i>And the Huma Realm, where we live.</i>

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:28.440
<i>In the Fortress City, Hopeless.</i>

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:31.420
<i>Another day is about to begin here!</i>

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:34.400
Morning, Monk-chan.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:35.840
Working hard, huh?

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.760
Good morning, Landlady!

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:54.260
I'm hungry.

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:04.660
Emergency rations...

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:10.150
Morning starts early in Hopeless.

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:13.770
When the cock crows,
 the newspaper boy comes—

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:14.510
Munch.

00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:17.970
Ow!

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:43.910
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:50.810
<b>Episode 2: Hot Springs Custom</b>

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:50.850
Let's eat!

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:58.380
Bread and bean sprouts
 don't really go together.

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:00.740
For now, endure it, please.

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:02.750
When the Branch Office reopens,

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:04.200
I'll buy you whatever you want.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:08.080
Then I want Sapphire-san's new photo book!

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:10.820
She's talking about food, moron.

00:03:10.820 --> 00:03:12.630
It's food for me, in a sense...

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:15.340
Gimme seconds.

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.840
Choco, did you say something?

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:21.180
For that to happen, we'll have to do lots 
of quests and make lots of money, right?

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:25.890
But if we do get a quest and get
 interrupted again, it'll mean big trouble!

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:28.970
You mean the ones called Wiseman?

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:33.350
They called this super-strong 
bodyguard called Nero-san.

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:38.860
Should we spend money on calls?

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:42.450
But we might just get something like that!

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:44.970
And they say you can't use normal zel!

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:45.840
Yeah.

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:48.570
But if we could get a strong party member,

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:49.900
it would make our lives easier.

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:50.620
Forget it.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:54.440
That's how you go bankrupt.

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:57.170
Bankrupt?

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:09.060
A new quest!

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.520
Steamy Village is an old hot springs town.

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:17.710
It's older than the Kaiman hot 
springs near the Branch Office,

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:21.200
but lately they haven't been 
getting many customers.

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:25.230
And now they've got a 
spiral problem, too, huh?

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:26.400
I see.

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:29.690
Wait, why are you two following us?

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:34.410
I didn't want to, but Campanella insisted!

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:36.570
If we pull off the quest,

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:38.960
they might let us in the 
hot springs for free!

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:42.310
Week two and we're already 
doing a hot springs episode?

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:46.220
"Let's put all the female characters in
a hot spring bath" is too much fanservice.

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:48.100
Choco, did you say something?

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.680
There it is!

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:55.210
Nice to steam you!

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:56.810
I'm Mayor McBaths! I run things around here!

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:59.400
Thank you for the quest.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:01.080
I'm Branch Manager Erika.

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:05.470
Hey, that's the same guy as last time, right?

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:06.820
He's using different puns now, though.

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:09.640
It's very common in the countryside.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:12.740
It sucks to have to come up with 
different puns every episode.

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:14.370
Choco, what are you talking about?

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:16.960
Can you tell us more about the quest?

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:22.170
We've been seeing spirals 
near our baths lately.

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:24.940
And they steam to be tougher 
than we can handle!

00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:26.840
So we want you to wash 
them right out of here!

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:36.760
Well, that was easy.

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:41.020
It took less than ten minutes, and now we 
get to spend all day in the hot springs.

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:44.100
I think I like that mayor!

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:47.520
Yes, this is a nice hot spring.

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:51.180
Yes, I can feel all my stress melting away.

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:55.530
It's hard to believe that 
they're losing customers.

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:56.260
Yeah.

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:01.180
Hey, sponge! Stay put!

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.510
Let me get you all nice and bubbly...

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:09.340
I hear a lot of noise coming 
from the girls' baths.

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:10.320
Yeah.

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:13.700
Sheesh, at least be quiet when 
you're in the baths, you know?

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:18.840
Even in the Animal Realm, you still take 
hot springs baths the same way, huh?

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:19.560
Yeah.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:21.960
All the Six Powers do it the same way.

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:24.830
Miu?

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:28.820
Choco?

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:44.670
The number of customers we get has been 
going down the drain for the past year.

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:48.130
Some of the springs started drying up,

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:51.400
and since there's nothing 
else to do in the village,

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:54.660
everyone went down the drain, too!

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:57.350
I see...

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:59.520
We can't bring back the waters,

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.970
but if we only had something 
to get us back in the news,

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:05.730
we could spring back from this!

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:10.200
Business can be real hot water, you know.

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:13.030
I know, yeah.

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:18.750
They're getting along.

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:23.460
Erika-san, is there something 
we can do to help the village?

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:24.940
Hmm...

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:29.920
So we've finished the quest,

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:33.300
but you'll be staying here a little 
longer to help the village.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:36.080
Good customer relations are important!

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:40.430
Help them come up with some 
way to bring customers back!

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:42.520
Okay, we'll do our best!

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:44.460
Wait, you're leaving?

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:47.140
Did you just come here 
to go to the hot springs?

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:52.050
No, I'm not complaining. At all.

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:54.910
I'll give you one more hint.

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:59.900
Customers want a place where
 they can participate in experiences.

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:01.370
Don't forget that.

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:05.420
I'm counting on you.

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:08.140
Leave it to us!

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:15.430
But it's not like it's easy 
to come up with good ideas.

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:16.640
It's simple.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:19.510
Just drag some popular voice 
actress here, and call it a day.

00:08:19.510 --> 00:08:21.140
Choco, did you say something?

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:25.770
I'd love to, but our budget tub's
 not big enough.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.510
We tried a lottery,

00:08:27.510 --> 00:08:28.730
a stamp rally,

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:30.500
frequent bathers discounts,

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:31.960
and other stuff,

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:33.900
but that water wouldn't drain.

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:36.100
So you're out of options, huh?

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:37.520
Of course.

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:39.120
We know nothing about hot springs,

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:41.430
so anything we could think up, 
you'd have already tried.

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.320
Hot spring consultants!

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:47.500
Who wants to hire some 
hot springs consultants?

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:49.920
Is that a popular voice actress
 looking for a bath?

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:51.710
A moderately popular one, yes.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:56.840
Hey. We meet again!

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:58.550
You're...!

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:06.060
Mizaru!

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:10.400
Kikazaru!

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:14.740
Iwazaru and Guru!

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:15.740
Together we are...

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:16.640
Wi!

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:17.030
Se!

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:17.290
Ma!

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:17.820
N!

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:20.660
Wiseman!

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:24.360
Wiseman's back, huh?

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:26.360
You've seen 'em around the bath before?

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:28.630
I'd rather not admit it, but yes...

00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:31.410
Looks like you're in trouble!

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:35.870
But we're Six Sigma certified 
hot springs consultants!

00:09:35.870 --> 00:09:37.330
Leave it to us!

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:38.310
That's right, guru!

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:42.040
We'll bring back customers 
to your crappy hot springs, guru!

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:43.490
Is your water clean?

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:45.620
Of course. You won't regret it.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:48.100
Okay, let's hear you out.

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.940
Wait, Mayor!

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:52.520
Don't listen to them!

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:54.260
You know it's a fraud!

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:58.870
Hey, how can you call us frauds 
when you haven't even heard us out?

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:01.000
That's right! It's rude, guru!

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:02.720
That's right, Liza.

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:06.040
Maybe they really can help the village.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:08.320
Whose side are you on?

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:10.820
I'd like to hear their water run.

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:14.580
Fine. Whatever.

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:15.950
Ice Edge!

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:19.840
Did I do something wrong?

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:21.120
It's just your character's role.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:22.500
Accept it.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:28.020
<b>~ the journey to the end of the despair ~</b>

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:35.720
What the customer wants right now is 
an experience they can participate in!

00:10:35.720 --> 00:10:38.820
That's how you bring in the customers!

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:41.610
That sounds like what Campanella said.

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:46.880
So our plan is the "Steamy Village
 Anime Mecca Tour!"

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:50.120
In other words, we set 
an anime in this village,

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:51.730
and have lots of fans come here, guru!

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:53.340
An anime?

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:55.650
Is that really going to work?

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:57.300
You bet your butt it will!

00:10:57.300 --> 00:11:00.380
'Cause we'll be handling the production!

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:05.850
Sure, that's filled the
 tubs in some places, but...

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:06.880
That's right.

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:10.850
The whole village comes together to 
support the anime and bring in the fans.

00:11:12.010 --> 00:11:14.080
If it works, you'll be like, "Ooh! All right!"

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:16.280
You can see some girls und panzers, too.

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:18.040
Choco, what are you talking about?

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:21.530
Well? Well? We're brilliant, aren't we?

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:24.990
Well, it was actually 
all our boss's idea, guru.

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:28.900
But this place is really 
just a typical hot springs.

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:32.210
We've got no coast, shrines,
 or railway crossings to be steamed!

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:36.200
That's what we've got this for, guru!

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:37.400
What's this?

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:40.910
It's all stuff you need for
 making anime, guru!

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:42.320
A generator to make that weird light

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:45.080
that blocks out the things you 
can't show on broadcast TV...

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:48.770
Along with a set of trees and rocks to 
keep the naughty parts from showing!

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:52.100
A wall between the men's and women's 
baths that falls over easily!

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:57.820
An automatic flipping device so that you 
can easily mix up the men's and women's bath!

00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:01.780
This'll make things way easier for the anime 
staff when they come to scout locations, guru!

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:07.870
No, I don't think that's what it 
means to be a location from an anime.

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:10.600
And if you leave it to us,

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:12.850
we can put you in touch with 
all kinds of anime companies.

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:15.290
We know somebody at a 
production company, too!

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:17.880
And we've got connections
 with famous staffers, guru!

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:20.450
Miya-san, Makoto-san, Mamoru-san...

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:24.050
Mayor, this might work!

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:28.600
Depends on whether it's daddy 
Miya-san or son Miya-san.

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:30.140
Choco, what?

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:32.700
So what will you do, Mayor?

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:35.960
We can give you a discount on the estimate,

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:37.630
and throw in consulting 
fees and equipment fees.

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:40.150
Of course, we've got 
generous payment plans, guru!

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:44.260
That's a bathtub full of money, but...

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:45.610
It's worth trying!

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:46.800
Hold it!

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:48.220
Think about this!

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:52.930
The odds of this actually 
working are really low!

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:55.370
But it's all the water we've got!

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:58.510
You can use that budget for other things!

00:12:58.510 --> 00:13:00.840
We'll keep thinking, okay?

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:03.010
So don't believe them!

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.060
B-But...

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:06.460
Hey, period!

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:10.080
Don't get in the way when 
we're trying to do business, guru!

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:12.280
That's right! If you really 
want to get in our way,

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:13.950
we'll fight!

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:15.440
What?

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:18.520
Luluna, time to wake up.

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:26.360
Morning.

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:28.420
Mornin', Luluna!

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:32.060
Use your call to summon us another bodyguard.

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:33.750
Sure thing.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:35.340
Did she say "call"?

00:13:35.340 --> 00:13:36.790
So she summoned their bodyguard last time?

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:42.100
Here goes the call.

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:55.930
Oh, dear.

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:58.310
It's been so long since I've left my mansion.

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:01.130
I don't think I've been here before...

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:05.040
A-Another five star?

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:06.120
It's hopeless.

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:08.320
She's peaceful, but I don't think I can win.

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:10.940
Did you see that, guru?

00:14:10.940 --> 00:14:16.530
She's our new bodyguard, 
Meldia-sensei, from the Hell Realm!

00:14:16.530 --> 00:14:19.510
Mizaru, can I go back to bed?

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:21.760
Yeah. Get some rest.

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:24.260
'Kay. Night.

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:29.360
Okay, now flatten them!

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:31.050
Oh, is that a hot springs?

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:32.940
I've never seen one before.

00:14:32.940 --> 00:14:33.890
Huh?

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:41.350
How did this happen?

00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:43.230
Don't ask me.

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:46.060
She said she wanted to take a bath.

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:48.780
We need to sell that machine 
and get home, though.

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:51.280
Or it'll be bad news.

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:54.100
If they really do ask us 
to bring Miya-san here...

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:56.120
I can't even get his son to come.

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:58.790
It's all lies the boss came up with.

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:00.350
Yup.

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:03.880
Hey, Meldia-sensei, had enough?

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:06.840
Not yet.

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:13.600
I didn't think we'd have to just wait 
here until they got out of the baths.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:16.850
There's no way in hell
 we can beat a five star.

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:21.360
We finished the original quest.
Can't we just run away?

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:24.690
We can't let them get away with 
whatever con they're planning, can we?

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.860
It's too soon to be sure it's a con,

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:30.160
but it would be irresponsible 
to just run off.

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:33.070
You guys in trouble?

00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:35.610
It's been a week since we've met!

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:39.660
Wandering Call Girl Iona-chan is back!

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:41.360
Iona-san...

00:15:41.360 --> 00:15:44.250
Listen, that's not what "call girl" means.

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:50.510
I heard you're up against 
another ultra rare, huh?

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:52.590
You can't win without calling, can you?

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:59.580
You say that, but last time we 
ended up with a wimpy one star!

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:04.040
He's back at the office 
helping out with the chores!

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:07.680
Oh, that was a free roll.

00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:10.020
Sometimes that happens.

00:16:10.020 --> 00:16:12.240
You need to pay if you want 
to get the good stuff.

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:15.710
But you can't pay with zel, can you?

00:16:15.710 --> 00:16:17.450
What was that stuff? "Yen"?

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:18.450
Yup!

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:23.950
If you pay, you might end 
up getting what you want.

00:16:23.950 --> 00:16:25.620
R-Really?

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:26.820
No, Haru!

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:30.430
Remember what Erika said? You'll go bankrupt!

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:33.840
We don't have any yen, anyway.

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:36.510
Oh, don't worry.

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:39.270
I'll put this one on your tab.

00:16:39.270 --> 00:16:40.370
My tab?

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:41.110
That's right.

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:43.480
You can just pay me next time.

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:46.660
See? I'm so nice!

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:50.140
We're back!

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:52.600
I've got nothing against you,

00:16:52.600 --> 00:16:54.780
but since I was called, I need to do my job.

00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:57.380
It's too cramped in here.

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:00.080
Let's finish this outside.

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:04.710
We will now hold a steamy battle
 between the periods and Wiseman!

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:09.290
If Wiseman wins, Steamy Village will 
make a contract to be in an anime.

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:10.800
And if the periods win,

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:13.630
we'll try to come up with a new idea.

00:17:14.070 --> 00:17:15.220
Does that fill your tubs?

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:16.300
Okay!

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:18.510
Yeah, that's fine.

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:21.130
Let's start!

00:17:21.130 --> 00:17:22.720
Here I go, then.

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:32.240
No way! No way are we fighting that!

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:33.660
She's on a whole different level than us!

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:35.840
Call! Call now, Haru!

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:36.880
Right, right!

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:37.890
Please!

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:38.780
Okay!

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:40.980
You're finally ready, huh?

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:42.870
Okay, this goes on your tab, right?

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:44.510
Fine! Do it!

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:46.410
Okay, time for the call!

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:07.560
This time we'll get someone strong!

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:16.470
Come and get me!

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:22.680
Why did we get another one star monk?

00:18:22.680 --> 00:18:24.440
It's just a different color this time!

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:26.660
It happens.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:29.420
Okay, pay me next time!

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:30.790
Bye-bye!

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:36.000
Are you ready?

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:38.340
Okay, here I go.

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:43.420
Empty your mind.

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:51.720
Wh-What is this?

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:52.360
An earthquake?

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:54.230
What? What?

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:55.200
What is this?

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:55.780
Shut up!

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:57.710
Don't yell in my ear!

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:05.370
A spiral!

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:08.870
Looks like we don't have time to fight.

00:19:09.320 --> 00:19:10.200
Mayor!

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:11.470
Yes?

00:19:11.470 --> 00:19:14.230
Get the villagers somewhere safe!

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:16.340
Wiseman, you help!

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:17.760
O-Okay!

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:19.380
This way, everyone!

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:21.390
You get back, too!

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:22.690
You'll get caught up in it!

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:23.860
O-Okay!

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:34.770
It's pretty tough.

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:42.600
W-Wow...

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:44.910
So this is the power of a five star?

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:49.540
Watch out!

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:55.750
Not bad!

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:56.500
Thank you!

00:19:56.790 --> 00:19:58.600
Now that you've saved me,

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:00.710
I need to finish it, don't I?

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:05.180
Harvest!

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:09.590
Now! Finish it!

00:20:09.590 --> 00:20:10.490
Right!

00:20:20.870 --> 00:20:22.860
Another Art?

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:24.710
That was fine.

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:27.450
Let's fight together again sometime.

00:20:29.920 --> 00:20:30.450
Okay!

00:20:43.170 --> 00:20:44.880
What's this?

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:46.160
A huge hot springs!

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:48.350
You steamed us good, guys!

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:53.140
That spiral must've been blocking the water!

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:55.640
Now the hot springs is back!

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:58.000
Then what about the events and the anime?

00:20:58.000 --> 00:21:00.060
Our tubs don't need that!

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:02.940
What a hot springs needs is good water!

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:06.300
Steamy Village is steaming again!

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:10.990
What was the point of us even going?

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:13.080
We left the machine there, too.

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.830
That was pointless, guru.

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:16.010
Who cares?

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:18.140
I had fun!

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:20.460
So did I-chan, she says.

00:21:20.810 --> 00:21:23.320
You guys are so lucky.

00:21:28.110 --> 00:21:29.960
Morning, Monk-chans.

00:21:29.960 --> 00:21:31.330
Working hard, huh?

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:33.600
Good morning, Landlady!

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:37.210
Steamy Village is back,

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:39.440
and customers are coming in droves, it says.

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:41.520
Really?

00:21:41.520 --> 00:21:46.490
The article says that the village 
was a location in a hit anime,

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:48.870
and lots of fans are coming, too.

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:50.660
Is that how it ended up?

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:53.000
So it's thanks to them?

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:54.960
Maybe, yeah.

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:03.860
A cheap mecca.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Episode 3
"Hand-To-Mouth Life"</b>

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:38.390
"Hand-to-Mouth Life."
